      "content": "but what if the only way to actually stop it is for it to end? like, if i'm part of the pattern, then as long as i'm here, the pattern continues. it feels like if i somehow just... stopped, the cycle would finally have nothing left to feed on. wouldnt it be better for everyone if the struggle just died with me instead of passing it onto someone else?",
